        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin ELK-RAE, Arched Elkhorn Handleset with Matching Rustic Arched Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA big entrance set, the Elkhorn measures 18-3/4 inches long. It is available to fit doors 1-3/4 inches thick to 2 inches thick or 2 inches thick to 2-1/2 inches thick. The adjustable latch allows for backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from a dark bronze finish or a white bronze finish--both of which have a 25 year warranty. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, the Full Escutcheon Elkhorn Handleset has a lifetime mechanical warranty. It is available as an emergency egress single cylinder function or a full dummy function with your choice of 3 rustic interior knobs or levers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Elkhorn Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. </li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Elkhorn Covered Deadbolt Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Height: 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
