                "description": "A big entrance set, the Elkhorn measures 18-3/4 inches long. It is available to fit doors 1-3/4 inches thick to 2 inches thick or 2 inches thick to 2-1/2 inches thick. The adjustable latch allows for backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from a dark bronze finish or a white bronze finish--both of which have a 25 year warranty. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, the Full Escutcheon Elkhorn Handleset has a lifetime mechanical warranty. It is available as an emergency egress single cylinder function or a full dummy function with your choice of 3 rustic interior knobs or levers.",
